 79) ༄//
nyams len gyi 'phrang bdun bsal ba blo gros seng ger gnang ba//

// 516) ༄//
pu hreng jo bo rgyal por gnang ba'i spyan ras gzigs kyi sgrub thabs dang gsung phrin// oṃ swasti/ bla ma rin po ches jo bo rje sa bdag rgyal po/ byang chub sems dpa'i gdung rgyud/ mgo nag yongs kyi spyi rje/ rigs gsum mgon po'i sprul pa/ chos kyi rgyal po byang chub sems dpa'/ bla chen po'i spyan sngar zhu ba/ rje sa bdag gi rgyal po bla zhang*/ rje blon sku 'khor dang bcas pa thams cad sku khams shin tu bde ba dang*/ rang gzhan thams cad kyi phan pa dang bde ba'i don phun sum tshogs par bzhugs zhes khums/ de bdag cag thams cad la bka' drin che/ slad kyi don zhu ba/ de la jo bo nyid bdag thugs la 'dogs pa'i rang bzhin du bzhugs pas/ mjal bar bzhed ces khums/ de la jo bo bla chen po nyid pu hreng dang stod mnga' ris skor gsum phyogs ris dang bcas pa thams cad kyi mgon dang skyabs dang dpung gnyen du bzhugs pa la/ gshegs bzhud mdzad na/ de thams cad mgon skyabs dang bral ba'i phyir dang*/ lam shin tu ring ba dang*/ bgrod shin tu dka' bas 'o shin tu brgyal bar 'gyur ba'i phyir dang*/ bdag gi rig pa rig rig tur tur po rig pa 'di nyid la zhe sa'am bstod pa'am 'dug lugs su brjod na/ byang chub kyi sems skye ba med cing spros pa thams cad kyi mtha' dang bral ba/ gdod nas rang bzhin gyis rnam par dag pa 'di nyid/ jo bo nyid kyi thugs kyang de yin la/ de gnyis dbyer med pa gcig tu gyur pas/ bgrod par bya ba'i yul/ bgrod par byed mkhan gnyis med pa/ 'bral ba med pa/ lhun gyis grub pa/ rgyun chad med par thugs su chud par bya ba'i phyir dang*/ rgya la'am gal te dper bgyis na/ bla ma gong ma'i thugs de lta bu byis pa so so'i skye bo//
tshu rol mthong ba'i rten gyi gang zag gis/ bla ma la mos gus byas na/ bla ma'i thugs gnyis su med pa'i ye shes dang*/ rang gi sems gcig tu 'dres nas/

// 590) ༄//
'khor ba thog mtha' med pas mi dmigs par bsngo ba gdams pa// yang 'di skad bdag gi thos pa dus gcig na/ stod lung pa gnas brtan gyis g.yang gzar ba rtswa ri 'dra la/ ga tho mu ther btang ba snyan par byung bas 'di la ngas dge 'dun la ngo sprod zhig byed na/ sngon 'phags pa gro zhun skyes rna ba bye ba ri bya ba pha phyug pas bang ba byed pa nyi shu yod pa zhig la bud med nas glu longs byas pas bud med zhig la bu zhig skar ma gro zhun la skyes pa dang*/ khyod rang rgyal po'i khab na yod pa la bang chen btang nas bu yod zhes pas lan bzhi'i bar du bu yod dam zer/ de ma rigs nas kha rog bsdad pa la khyod kyi bu yod bya ba lan du byas pas kha gser phyes 'gengs pa yin pa la/ de lan gsum du bgad zer te/ de nas bu des rab tu byung ba la drug sdes mar gsar gyi gong bu lta bu brtson 'grus dang brtul zhugs mi nus pa yang bstan pa la rab tu byung nas 'bras bu ni 'byin mi nus zhes pas/ kho khe grags skyes nas kun dga' bo la gdams pa zhus nas dur khrod du phyin nas 'chags byas te sa'i steng du rdo gcal byas nas de'i steng du 'gro ba 'chag pa 'ba' zhig gis 'bad pa byas pas ting nge 'dzin gcig kyang ma skyes pas yid mug te babs snyam pa dang*/ sangs rgyas kyis mkhyen nas gro zhun skyes 'dir shog sngon gyi pi wang sbreng shes sam shes na/ rgyud grims pa las skad 'byung ngam mi 'byung*/ lhod pa las 'byung ngam mi 'byung*/ ran pa ma bcos pa las 'byung ba de bzhin du sangs rgyas kyi chos thams cad kyang de ltar ro//
zhes gsungs pas kho dgra bcom pa thob ste/ 'di sngon nas rang bshad pas sgom shes pa mang po 'byung ba yin te skyes bu kun lhug pa de las 'byung ba yin/ des na 'dul ba'i don thams cad dbu ma ston pa yin te spros pa'i mtha' brgyad dang bral ba'i 'phags lam brgyad pa ston pa yin/
